    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the site being located within an area of land liable to flooding and the lack of a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, including a lack of &lt;/span&gt;compensatory flood storage details and a drainage strategy&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;, has failed to demonstrate that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
